Future Interface

Imagine opening any AI and providing only:

Load PRC:
    User_Corpus_v12

The model doesn’t become you.

Instead, it gains access to a portable reasoning environment with your accumulated vocabulary, abstractions, and design patterns. Another model could load the same corpus and reason differently while still operating from the same conceptual foundation.

⸻

I think the enduring idea here isn’t that one model becomes all-powerful. It’s that continuity migrates from the model to the corpus. Models evolve. Hardware changes. Interfaces come and go. A well-designed, versioned reasoning corpus can become the durable layer that preserves and grows a person’s intellectual work across those changes.